<section class="panel prose"><span class="eyebrow">GETTING STARTED · 4 MIN READ</span><h2>From invitation to first sign-in</h2><p>There is no public employee signup. Your team PIC starts the invitation process.</p><ol><li><strong>Accept your invitation.</strong> Open the link sent to your existing contact email. Acceptance does not grant application access.</li><li><strong>Wait for administrator review.</strong> Your details must be approved before mailbox setup begins.</li><li><strong>Wait for mailbox readiness.</strong> An actual company mailbox must be created or verified. Mock mode cannot provide a real mailbox.</li><li><strong>Activate your account.</strong> Follow instructions sent to your invitation email and confirm your worker ID against the approved record.</li><li><strong>Choose a password.</strong> Set your own private application password, then sign in with your assigned company email.</li></ol><div class="notice"><x-design.icon name="shield" /><span>A worker ID is a matching step, not a secret or sufficient proof of identity.</span></div><a class="button secondary" href="{{ $url('faq') }}">{{ $design['pages']['faq']['title'] }}<x-design.icon name="arrow" /></a></section>
